The Dark Bramble was a great power that came to [[Geography/Althane/index|Althane]] in a time before the present cycle. The people of Althane built [[Phenomena/Althane/The Lighthouse|the Lighthouse]], working with the [[Divinity/Thessians|Thessians]] and the great ship Shoa, to capture it. The Dark Bramble came, there was a great fight, and everyone who fought died; the world was remade with its memory taken, and the Lighthouse stayed behind to keep it.

The Crystalpoint Lattice came with the Dark Bramble and spent years trying to bring it back to power, reaching out to Thessians it believed were still alive. The quarry who piloted the Lattice were tethered to it, and it was they who woke [[Divinity/Unknown Entities/Nox|Nox]].
